<http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/F2_Expression> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/F2_Expression> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E73_Information_Object> .
<http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/F2_Expression> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/> .
<http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/F2_Expression> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In DeSMòS, F2 Expression is used to represent the textual realisation of a work, on which literary constraints and relations to other texts are documented. The properties that can be used with this class are crm:P130_shows_features_of, crm:P148_has_component, crm:P2_has_type, lrmoo:R15_has_fragment, lrmoo:R4i_is_embodied_in and lrmoo:R76_is_derivative_of."@en .
<http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/F2_Expression> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In DeSMòS, F2 Expression è utilizzata per rappresentare la realizzazione testuale di un'opera, sulla quale vengono documentate le costrizioni letterarie e le relazioni con altri testi. Le proprietà che possono essere usate con questa classe sono crm:P130_shows_features_of, crm:P148_has_component, crm:P2_has_type, lrmoo:R15_has_fragment, lrmoo:R4i_is_embodied_in e lrmoo:R76_is_derivative_of."@it .
<http://iflastandards.info/ns/lrm/lrmoo/F2_Expression> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "F2 Expression"@en .
